ns (MSME Loan &amp; Mudra Loan - Term Loan &amp; Working Capital Loan) and Retail Loans (Personal Loan, Home Loan &amp; Auto Loan) in less than 59 minutes.</description><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:02:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>Punjab &amp; Sind Bank | Saving Accounts | Loan Schemes</title><link>https://punjabandsind.bank.in/</link><description>Discover savings and current accounts, home loans, deposits and secure digital banking services. For assistance, call us at 1800-419-8300.</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 00:56:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>Apply for Loans Online - PSB Loans in 59 Minutes</title><link>https://www.psbloansin59minutes.com/home</link><description>PSB Loans in 59 Minutes enables you to get the Digital approval letter of Business Loans (MSME Loan &amp; Mudra Loan - Term Loan &amp; Working Capital Loan) and Retail Loans (Personal Loan, Home Loan &amp; Auto Loan) in less than 59 minutes.</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 18:36:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>Punjab &amp; Sind Bank Introduces Digital Loan Scheme for MSMEs</title><link>https://apacnewsnetwork.com/2025/01/punjab-sind-bank-introduces-digital-loan-scheme-for-msmes/</link><description>New Delhi: Punjab &amp; Sind Bank has announced plans to launch an instant loan scheme for micro, small, and medium enterprises (MSMEs) offering credit up to ₹25 lakh. The scheme, set to roll out this month, is part of the bank’s push to expand digital lending and streamline credit delivery.</description><pubDate>Sun, 05 Jan 2025 23:53:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>Punjab National Bank</title><link>https://pnb.bank.in/Blog-PNB-Digi-MSME-Loan.html</link><description>Digi MSME Loan: A unified digital platform delivering hassle-free financing solutions for Micro and Small Enterprises, with credit facilities up to Rs 25.00 Lakh, across manufacturing, trading, and service sectors.</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 10:38:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>Apply for MSME Loan Online - PSB Loans in 59 Minutes</title><link>https://www.psbloansin59minutes.com/msme-loan</link><description>With PSB59, the pioneers in MSME financing, you can get digital approvals for MSME loans ranging from ₹10 Lac to ₹5 Crores and within 59 minutes, with a simple, single application.</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 18:09:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>Apply for Digital MSME Loan | Bank of Baroda</title><link>https://bankofbaroda.bank.in/business-banking/msme-banking/loans-and-advances/digital-msme-loan</link><description>Digital MSME Loan can be applied by the businesses to meet operating expenses, purchasing inventory, receivables financing &amp; other business needs. Apply for digital MSME loan now!</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:09:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n\nFILE=/Users/d111879/Documents/Project/DEMO/Student/Student_mobile/sapp/research/agent_runs/madhya-pradesh-government-verified-v2/workspaces/govt-college-bareli-raisen/tmp/mpbareli.HpbzlJ/q2.xml\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\" ?><rss version=\"2.0\"><channel><title>Bing: mphighereducation.nic.in/gpgcbareli</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=mphighereducation.nic.in%2fgpgcbareli</link><description>Search results</description><image><url>http://www.bing.com:80/s/a/rsslogo.gif</url><title>mphighereducation.nic.in/gpgcbareli</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=mphighereducation.nic.in%2fgpgcbareli</link></image><copyright>Copyright © 2026 Microsoft. All rights reserved. These XML results may not be used, reproduced or transmitted in any manner or for any purpose other than rendering Bing results within an RSS aggregator for your personal, non-commercial use. Any other use of these results requires express written permission from Microsoft Corporation. By accessing this web page or using these results in any manner whatsoever, you agree to be bound by the foregoing restrictions.</copyright>\n<item><title>Badge verifikasi pada channel - Bantuan YouTube</title><link>https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/3046484?hl=id</link><description>Harap diingat: Channel terverifikasi tidak mendapatkan fitur tambahan di YouTube. Verifikasi pada channel juga tidak merepresentasikan penghargaan, pencapaian, atau endorsement dari YouTube. Untuk mengetahui info mengenai penghargaan, pelajari program Creator Awards YouTube lebih lanjut.</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:13:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>YouTube Nonprofit Program overview</title><link>https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/3545195?hl=en</link><description>The YouTube Nonprofit Program helps nonprofits connect with supporters, volunteers, and donors. For many causes, video is a new but essential format for storytelling.</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 07:10:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>如何在中国大陆用「合法」的方式观看到youtube上面的「有价值」的视频？ - 知乎</title><link>https://www.zhihu.com/question/1903231775980913051</link><description>只要你 配置点击代理。 当你下抖音、B站的素材时，它知道这是国内的，直接走你家正常的宽带大马路，速度拉满，绝不绕远路。 当你扔给它一个 YouTube 链接时，它会自动识别，切换到合法的通道去帮你把视频“捎带”回来。 你不需要当网管，也不需要懂什么 HTTP 或者 SOCKS5 协议。你平时雷打不动“不使用代理”，遇到这种特殊合规需求时，点一下保存，剩下的活全自动。</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 16:28:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>YouTube公司 - 知乎</title><link>https://www.zhihu.com/topic/19550532</link><description>YouTube，全球最大的视频分享网站，早期公司总部位于加利福尼亚州的圣布里诺。公司由华裔美籍华人陈士骏等人创立并于2005年2月15日注册，网站的口号为“Broadcast Yourself”（表现你自己），网站的名称和标志皆是自早期电视所使用的阴极射线管发想而成。2006年11月，Google公司以16.5亿美元收购了YouTube，并把其当做一间子公司来经营。2014年1月3日，YouTube宣布在拉斯维加斯 ...</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 07:09:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>報告履歴を表示する - YouTube ヘルプ</title><link>https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/7687979?hl=ja</link><description>YouTube は ユーザーから報告された動画 を確認し、その動画が YouTube の コミュニティ ガイドライン に違反しているかどうかを判断します。 報告履歴 ページにアクセスすると、YouTube で報告した動画のステータスを確認できます。 ライブ: まだ審査されていないか、YouTube コミュニティ ガイドラインに違反していないと判断された動画。 削除済み: YouTube から削除された ...</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 21:58:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>Mettre en ligne des vidéos YouTube</title><link>https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/57407?hl=fr&amp;co=GENIE.Platform%3DAndroid</link><description>Mettre en ligne des vidéos Utilisez l'application YouTube pour Android pour enregistrer une nouvelle vidéo ou en sélectionner une existante à mettre en ligne. Utiliser l'application YouTube Ouvrez l'application YouTube . Appuyez sur Créer Vidéo. Sélectionnez le fichier que vous souhaitez mettre en ligne, puis appuyez sur SUIVANT.</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 12:11:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>YouTube Ajutor - Google Help</title><link>https://support.google.com/youtube/?hl=ro</link><description>Centrul oficial de ajutor YouTube unde puteţi găsi sfaturi şi tutoriale despre utilizarea produsului şi alte răspunsuri la întrebări frecvente.</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 21:39:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>YouTube TV Help</title><link>https://support.google.com/youtubetv/?hl=en</link><description>Official YouTube TV Help Center where you can find tips and tutorials on using YouTube TV and other answers to frequently asked questions.</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 05:58:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>YouTube Trợ giúp - Google Help</title><link>https://support.google.com/youtube/?hl=vi</link><description>Trung tâm Trợ giúp YouTube chính thức, nơi bạn có thể tìm thấy các mẹo và hướng dẫn sử dụng sản phẩm và các câu trả lời khác cho các câu hỏi thường gặp.</description><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:16:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n<item><title>YouTube Premium &amp; YouTube Music Premium supported devices</title><link>https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/6308244?hl=en</link><description>If you have YouTube Premium or YouTube Music Premium, your membership benefits are available across all devices with access to YouTube. Learn more about our paid YouTube memberships.</description><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 15:55:00 GMT</pubDate></item>\n\nFILE=/Users/d111879/D